// Provincial pricing across the channels a distillery actually sells
// through.
//
// Provincial liquor statutes do not set markup rates — both jurisdictions
// researched delegate to board policy, which changes without a
// legislative amendment. So every rate here carries its provenance, and a
// channel that needs a rate nobody has found REFUSES to produce a number
// rather than guessing one. A pricing page that looks authoritative is
// worse than one that admits what it doesn't know.

